# Mutation plan for the licensed half of the three group syncable writes (D-390), 2026-09-13.
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/group-syncables-licensed.plan
#
# Two kinds of decision: the translated SQL of the four membership queries and the two
# `UpdateMembersRole`s (store lines, held by `db_group_syncable_store`), and the branch-level
# facts of the handlers and the app layer (api lines, held by the licensed half of
# `parity::group_syncables` against the licensed pair). The last two lines are the no-op
# controls and must SURVIVE.
sync-toadd-readd-join-inverted	crates/mm-store/src/group_syncable_store.rs	               AND ($3 OR (tm.userid IS NULL AND (gm.createat >= $1 OR gt.updateat >= $1)))	               AND ($3 OR (tm.userid IS NOT NULL AND (gm.createat >= $1 OR gt.updateat >= $1)))	store	team_members_to_add
